Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.61,0:00:02.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But you know what, Satoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.37,0:00:05.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Before, I could only ever picture\Na life of solitude for myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.99,0:00:08.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but now I have a family to call my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.67,0:00:11.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And it's all because you were there for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.02,0:00:11.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Thank you," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There, there! Hungry, are we?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.63,0:00:25.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, I saved Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.80,0:00:50.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then, we tried to make sure \NNakanishi Aya and Misato weren't alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've regained...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.59,0:01:04.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...my memories!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.11,0:02:47.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kazu's a carpenter, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.11,0:02:49.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like both him and Osamu are working hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.72,0:02:53.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. By the way, Misato said \Nshe'd come stop by here soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.12,0:02:59.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought she hated me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.13,0:03:01.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Takes me back.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.17,0:03:04.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You had your ups and downs, huh?\NLike that lunch money affair.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.04,0:03:05.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But, you know,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.02,0:03:11.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,she was the one who suggested a fundraiser\Nto help with your hospital bills.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.01,0:03:13.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.03,0:03:16.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were trying to save Misato that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've remembered everything, haven't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.51,0:03:26.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.56,0:03:29.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to get you guys involved.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's been fifteen years.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.29,0:03:37.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All the evidence is gone, and I doubt\Nanyone will believe anything I say.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.15,0:03:45.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Seeing you wake up after fifteen\Nyears made me really happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.33,0:03:49.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was simply overjoyed that you came back to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.52,0:03:52.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So I avoided asking you about the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've fought enough already,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.61,0:03:59.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and I didn't want to disturb you while\Nyour body and mind were still healing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.54,0:04:04.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But if you're thinking about fighting\Nall by yourself again, don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take us with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.95,0:04:14.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,While Hiromi kept visiting you in the hospital,\Nhe found his calling as a doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.09,0:04:18.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I became a lawyer, and I'm still searching\Nfor your attacker with Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were our hero back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.95,0:04:28.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Our desire to catch up to you and fight\N with you is what made us who we are today.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.61,0:04:30.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was the same when we\Nhelped Hinazuki, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.80,0:04:34.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You believed in me and gave\Nme your side of the story.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.22,0:04:37.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I did my part and believed in you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.77,0:04:43.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,It's for my own sake that I want to trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.04,0:04:46.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,135,,Similar to someone wanting to be trusted,\Nbut the other way around.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.96,0:04:47.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,{\i1}Airi...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.45,0:04:53.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have friends I can trust.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.05,0:05:02.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The killer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.83,0:05:03.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.76,0:05:06.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.52,0:05:11.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I tapped my finger on \Nyour wheelchair on the way here...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.63,0:05:14.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you stifled a reaction, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.98,0:05:23.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you predicted my every move and foiled my plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was far beyond...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.22,0:05:38.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...the level of a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.81,0:05:45.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was as though you could see the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.88,0:05:49.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know what lies in your future!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.19,0:05:56.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How could you predict my thoughts?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.99,0:05:59.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What did you mean,\N you knew what lies in my future?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.14,0:06:03.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not like telling you would stop you from killing me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.44,0:06:10.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You have a cell phone in your pocket, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.18,0:06:13.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're either recording this yourself,\Nor on the phone with someone who is.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I assume that someone is Kenya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.84,0:06:33.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The statute of limitations has passed\Non the case from fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.03,0:06:37.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so you wanted to make me talk about cases\Nwhose statute hadn't passed yet, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.15,0:06:41.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, they don't exist.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.30,0:06:45.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you'll never be able to catch me, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look, you have a text from Kumi-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.53,0:06:55.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Her IV drip starts at 4:30 p.m.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But today's bag is laced with muscle relaxants.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, your fingerprints are on the bag, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.24,0:07:07.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've granted a merciful death to a young\Ngirl who was worried about her surgery.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.73,0:07:11.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And racked with guilt, I take my own\Nlife by jumping off this rooftop.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.97,0:07:19.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you told me how you \Nwere able to predict my thoughts,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.86,0:07:22.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,there's nothing you can do to save your own life.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But you can save Kumi-chan's life.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.27,0:07:29.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How do I know for sure that\Nyou'll spare her life if I talk?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.60,0:07:32.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You don't, obviously.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.44,0:07:34.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But there is a possibility.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.54,0:07:37.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you don't talk, you'll erase the possibility.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad. We're out of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.43,0:07:48.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This was an all-or-nothing gamble for me as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.01,0:07:51.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But in the end, there was no particular\Nreason you foresaw my moves, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.29,0:07:54.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was all dumb luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.82,0:07:58.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What you said about knowing \Nwhat lies in my future was a bluff, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.66,0:08:07.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll put all my heart into writing \Nyour parting words to your mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.32,0:08:13.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bye, Satoru. I've got a morning shift tomorrow,\Nso I'll see you in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sleeping, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.79,0:08:20.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ma...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My memories have actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.96,0:08:27.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...returned, haven't they?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.60,0:08:30.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know. It must've happened \Nwhen Kayo-chan visited.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.65,0:08:36.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you didn't tell her to keep quiet, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When Kenya-kun and Hiromi-kun left after their first visit,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.86,0:08:45.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I felt like I'd made a mistake.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.24,0:08:49.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,'Cause you boys couldn't \Nspeak from the heart that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.76,0:08:54.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I saw Kayo-chan and her baby,\N I couldn't bring myself to have her keep quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.46,0:08:58.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, she came to see you\N after waiting fifteen long years.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.53,0:09:04.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I looked at your face\N and talked to you every single day.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.95,0:09:09.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But only when you started talking and \NI noticed how much your voice had changed...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.01,0:09:12.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...did I realize that you'd grown up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It made me so happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My baby boy is an adult now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.29,0:09:23.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.72,0:09:26.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to live life digging deep\Nand taking that extra step.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bit late for that, don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.78,0:09:33.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's how you lived your life even before the coma.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.54,0:09:43.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Filling the holes in ourselves\Nis what life's all about."
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.04,0:09:48.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's part of the graduation day speech\NI gave the sixth graders I was in charge of.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.37,0:09:50.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The day Hinazuki was placed\Nunder protective custody,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.91,0:09:53.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I stood beside you and saw\Nyour face in the falling snow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.25,0:09:57.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the one look of yours\NI remember most clearly.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.19,0:10:02.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\move(960,1020,960,937.5,0,794)}My father left soon after I was born,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,so I don't remember how he looked at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.58,0:10:11.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,But back then, you took his place.\NYou were my father.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.52,0:10:15.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,143,,You filled the gaping hole in my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.23,0:10:25.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I spent fifteen years waiting for you to wake up, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.16,0:10:32.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I lost you, I also lost\Nthe impulse that defined me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I waited for so long.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.70,0:10:37.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.17,0:10:38.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're not alone anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.45,0:10:42.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What decides this little game of ours?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The police catching you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You killing me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.95,0:10:51.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The game is already over.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.03,0:10:52.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm pretty sure I won.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.70,0:10:58.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hinazuki Kayo, Nakanishi Aya, Hiromi, and Yuuki-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.53,0:11:00.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I saved all of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Even Ma, whom you murdered in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.65,0:11:05.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Murdered in the future"?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.99,0:11:11.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You wanted to know how I could foil your plans?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was because I know what lies in your future.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.35,0:11:19.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I could keep everyone safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.73,0:11:24.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you couldn't kill\N even one person connected to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.23,0:11:27.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Including myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.19,0:11:31.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could've killed you anytime I pleased, Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I could kill you right now, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.34,0:11:37.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But for fifteen whole years, you didn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.09,0:11:40.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because you needed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was your purpose in life.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was your hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.57,0:11:48.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I filled the gaping hole in your heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.59,0:11:55.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I beat you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.86,0:11:57.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wrong, wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This time's no different.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.54,0:12:02.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll win again!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.36,0:12:29.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.11,0:12:35.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years is a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.48,0:12:39.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I was asleep, so it went by in a flash for me,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.43,0:12:43.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but it must've felt like an eternity for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's only because I'm around that you're alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.55,0:13:18.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That you feel alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.82,0:13:26.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've repeated my life several times now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've killed several of my friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.01,0:13:33.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I bear no hatred towards you anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.76,0:13:37.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Because there's only one person in\N this world who knows the real you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.84,0:13:39.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Satoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.09,0:14:08.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.78,0:14:13.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,...live without you anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.27,0:15:04.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He was immediately arrested for attempted murder.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is Kumi-chan all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.40,0:15:11.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we didn't tell her about Yashiro,\Nwhat with her surgery coming up and all.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.05,0:15:15.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"I believe" is such an odd turn of phrase, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you truly believed \Nfrom the bottom of your heart,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.33,0:15:21.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't need to spell it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.90,0:15:24.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's like saying, "I believe in air."
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.59,0:15:27.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So people only say "they believe"\Nwhen they doubt something?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.73,0:15:32.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to say that "believing\Nin something" is a barefaced lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.18,0:15:37.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just that they are words of hope\Nborn from a desire to believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.88,0:15:54.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lost my life between the ages of 11 to 25.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.40,0:15:59.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the time I lost is my treasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a town from which only I was erased,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.98,0:16:06.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my friends spent precious times\Nin their lives on my behalf.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know heroes always arrive fashionably late.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.74,0:16:12.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.94,0:16:13.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.58,0:16:14.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.01,0:16:15.18,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,As stupid as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.99,0:16:20.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A town from which only I was erased, \Nand a time from which only I was erased...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those are my treasures.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.43,0:16:36.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I love how you dig deep as you draw.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.87,0:16:43.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going in that direction, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have you come all the way here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.89,0:16:48.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving on a trip?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.21,0:16:49.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.30,0:16:53.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Hokkaido to see some old friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.05,0:16:54.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, have a great weekend.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.91,0:17:00.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on the animated adaptation.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.91,0:17:12.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I make a living as a manga artist now.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.32,0:17:19.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't experienced Revival since then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.61,0:18:49.92,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,30,,{\an8}Two weeks until the opening of \Nthe 2010 Olympics in Vancouver...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.24,0:18:58.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going for a walk.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.05,0:19:06.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, they said we'd get even\Nmore snowfall in the evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.07,0:19:43.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"My Hero," by Fujinuma Satoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.69,0:19:48.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have the courage to \Ndig deep and take the first step.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I don't have any allies.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.68,0:19:54.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do have friends to have fun with,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.47,0:19:57.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I think "friends" and "allies" are different.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.10,0:20:03.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yesterday, I watched the final episode \Nof my favorite show, "Fight, Wonder Guy!"
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.41,0:20:08.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the start of the show, Wonder Guy fought alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.65,0:20:11.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\i1}He got knocked down again and again,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.53,0:20:14.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he never gave up, and he mustered\Nup the courage to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You can't carve open a path without\Ndigging deep and taking the extra step,"
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.83,0:20:21.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he said, and kept fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.70,0:20:28.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then, the people he moved with his\Ncourage became his allies one by one.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.54,0:20:32.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why, even when it looked like he \Nwas going to lose to the bad guy at the end,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.01,0:20:36.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he never stopped believing that\Nhis allies would come to his aid.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.93,0:20:41.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But unlike Wonder Guy,\NI don't have courage or allies.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,53,,{\i1}So I felt extremely envious of him.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.65,0:20:51.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It made me want to grow up to have true allies\Nwith whom I'd share a bond of trust.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.07,0:22:10.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's really coming down, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.19,0:22:14.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They said on TV it's the most snowfall\NKanto has had in a decade.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.65,0:22:26.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mind if I take shelter from the snow with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I always believed.
